WEBVTT

NOTE Post Social – Quickstart walkthrough. Voiceover (on-screen text is in the picture).

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.520
Your first post, in four steps.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.600
First, connect an account.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:11.600
Pick a platform, and sign in on its own page.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.180
Post Social never sees your password.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:20.960
Next, connect Claude, ChatGPT, or any AI agent.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:25.140
Copy the connector address from Post Social, and add it to your agent.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.880
Here, we'll use Claude.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:30.520
Post Social asks you to allow it.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.500
Press Allow, and Claude is connected.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:38.480
Now just ask, in plain words.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:42.460
Say what to post, where, and when.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:46.440
Give it a time, or say now, or it stays a draft.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.240
Then check that it went out.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:54.080
It's live when it says Live, with a link to the post.
